{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26127","headline":"金谷园花发怀古 · 王质","name":"金谷园花发怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寥金谷涧，花发旧时园。\n人事空怀古，烟霞此独存。\n管弦非上客，歌舞少王孙。\n繁蘂风惊散，轻红鸟乍翻。\n山川终不改，桃李自无言。\n今日经尘路，凄凉讵可论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王质","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}